A||||4||Wade87GT||Catless and Borla||||14||
Z||000000||Wade87GT||04-22-2001||01:04 AM||||I finally completed my exhaust upgrade today and what a difference! Huge gains according to the BioDyno2001 (Seat O' Pantsmeter). I installed a Borla system I bought from Fiero Parts and Appraisals. Instead of a cat, I used one of those flex pipes (stainless wire mesh, like you see on some factory systems)that J.C. Whitney just started to offer. It sounds almost like ALMS car, but not as loud and I actually hit the rev limiter when I wasn't looking! I had a high flow cat with the Borla before but it had a bad resonance around 2500 RPM. Not anymore anywhere through the rev scale.<P>Wade<P>"Flex pipe will be used, in leu of catalytic converter, for testing purposes only."  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||14
Z||000001||88formula||04-22-2001||07:30 PM||||COOL! I've got the Borla exhaust system but haven't installed it yet. You might notice an improvement in your gas mileage also as long as you drive like you did before. <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88formula_logo_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Black88GT||04-22-2001||11:47 PM||||I have the same setup on my car.  Sounds sweet doesn't it?  The cool part is, it's only slightly louder then stock at idle, so you won't get a bunch of ricers trying to race all the time at redlights, but at WOT its loud.  Not quite as deep as a V8 but the next best thing.<P><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD - MAFOA<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://88database.homestead.com/files/AF.gif">    <BR><I>"Once you go black, you never go back..."</I><BR><I>"The Customer Can Have Any Color He Wants So Long As It's Black" </I> -Henry Ford||||reg||14
Z||000003||Wade87GT||04-23-2001||11:25 AM||||Yeah Black, I love the sound! I still get challenged by the Ricers since my car is lowered so much. But my experience with nonchalance and some nice torque beats them off the line every time. I usually back off around 5 over the limit. Then they pass me.<P>Wade||||reg||14
